# `cdk synth` / `cdk deploy` write the assembled CloudFormation here. It is a
# BUILD PRODUCT — regenerate it, never review it, and never commit it: a synth
# run resolves context (account ids, hosted-zone ids) into the assembly.
cdk.out/
*.cdk.staging/
# CDK's lookup cache. A deploy with a real account writes the account id and the
# region's availability zones here. That is deployment configuration, so it stays
# on the operator's machine and out of this repository.
cdk.context.json
